# Leafora currently has no backend and no third-party API keys — every
# feature (cart, saved list, community board, language toggle) runs entirely
# in the browser via localStorage. There is nothing secret to configure yet.
#
# This file exists so that if a real integration is added later — a payment
# provider for checkout, an email service for the watering nudge, and so on —
# there is already a safe place for it. Copy this file to .env, fill in real
# values there, and .env stays out of git (see .gitignore).
#
# Example, once one of those exists:
# PAYMENT_PROVIDER_KEY=
# EMAIL_SERVICE_API_KEY=
